module System

### Represents the aggregate protocol for plain value records.
### `RecordType` identifies the value-semantics category: copying duplicates the value and the
### layout is structural. It obeys no other protocol: the builder gives a record `Equatable` only when
### every member variable has `==` (or the record writes its own `eq`), and `Hashable`/`Comparable` only
### when the record declares `obeys` for them. Conferring them here would promise an `eq` even for a
### record whose member variable has none.
protocol RecordType
